ings, and explore at your own pace. There are no timers, just pure discovery. The immersive environment draws you into a narrative of intrigue and beauty.\n\nCrafted with VR passion, this journey awaits. Wishlist now and prepare to unlock the gallery\u2019s deepest mysteries!\n", "short_description": "Step Into The Gallery: VR Secrets - Immerse yourself in a VR art gallery where every painting holds a hidden puzzle."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nannings.nz/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NanningsGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.nannings.nz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24947896548243874"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2246252525859366"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2246252525859366"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1763487960, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2246252525859366"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24956816030685259", "version": "1.0.2"}, "id": "1162000526021075", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {